<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Update the <code class="notranslate">Signature</code>, <code class="notranslate">Accept-Signature</code>, and <code class="notranslate">Signature-Input</code> headers to point to the RFC9421 rather than a WICG draft. Also <code class="notranslate">Signed-Headers</code> seems to to not be used, so changing in favor of <code class="notranslate">Signature-Input</code> which is defined. Based on <a href="https://github.com/WICG/webpackage/issues/713#issue-1142375682" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/WICG/webpackage/issues/713/hovercard">this issue</a>, the WICG http message signatures seems somewhat obsoleted?</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">Points to the adopted RFC rather than draft documents</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">n/a</p>
