        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF145 makes <code class="notranslate">RTCEncodedAudioFrame</code> and <code class="notranslate">RTCEncodeVideoFrame</code> be serializeable, which includes adding constructors.</p>
